  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「うん。そう、山條先輩は昔……。男の子として、育てられたんだって」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「山條先輩には、男のきょうだいがいないから。でも家を継ぐためには、男である必要があったんだって。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「だから昔は男装して、性別を偽ってたみたい」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「婚約者のひとはそのころ、山條先輩を見初めたみたいでね……。親に無理を言って、婚約を結んだとか」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「でないとどんなにお金を積まれたって、ただの成金を嫁に迎えるような家柄じゃないみたいだよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-swim-p",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-swim-p_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「名前を聞いて驚いちゃったもん、ほんと貴族っていうか名門っていうかね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「子供のころの初恋を、ずっと抱いてたの。すごく健気だよね、婚約者のひと」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-swim-p",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-swim-p_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「うん。鯱さん、頭の回転早いよね。そうなの、そこがポイント」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「子供のころ、性別を偽ってた山條先輩に恋をした……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-swim-p",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-swim-p_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「そう、婚約者のひとは『女の子』だったんだよ。ほんとほんと、冗談みたいな話」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-swim-p",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-swim-p_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「婚約者のひと、でも初恋を諦めきれなかったんだろうね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「どうしても、山條先輩と結婚したかったみたい。でも山條先輩も、女の子だもんね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「見ればわかるぐらいに、どれだけ野蛮に振る舞っても……。女の子だもん、花嫁衣装がよく似合うような。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-swim-p",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-swim-p_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「だから婚約者のひとは、男性として振る舞うようになったの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「男装して、性別を偽ってね。男と女なら、結婚できるもん。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「でも実際は女と女、日本じゃ結婚できない。もちろん、ハワイでもね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「それでも、婚約者のひとは諦めなかったみたいだけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-swim-p",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-swim-p_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「山條先輩を追いかけて、こんな海外まできて。強引に結婚式をあげて、既成事実をつくって……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「済し崩し的に、夫婦になるつもりだったのかな。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「それともふたりで手を取りあって、どっか海外にでも逃げるつもりだったのかも」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「女の子どうしでも結婚できる国、あるもんね。先にハワイで披露宴だけして、どっかで結婚して……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「あるいは、駆け落ちでもしたかったのかも」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「そんな婚約者のひとの純情は、でもご破算。残念だけど、ゲームオーバー……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-swim-p",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-swim-p_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「決めるのは山條先輩だけど、事実をねじ曲げて強引に～っていうのは駄目だと思うんだ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「たとえ、どんな結果になるとしても。できれば、祝福されるかたちで。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「結婚って『そういうもの』だもん、恋っていうのは……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-swim-p",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-swim-p_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「偉そうなこと、言えないけど。わたしみたいな、お子さまには」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-swim-p",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-swim-p_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「どっから入手したんだろうね……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「藍乃さんが婚約者のひとの病院のカルテとかコピーして保存して、携帯電話にいれてたよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「動かぬ、証拠になりそう」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「あとは日本に戻って、山條先輩と婚約者のひとと、それぞれの家族で話しあってもらう。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「そのために、とりあえず山條先輩を結婚式の会場から逃がしたんだって」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「わたしは、みんなが帰ってくるのを待ってるところ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-swim-p",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-swim-p_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「他のみんなとちがって、そんなに長距離は泳げないもん。携帯電話、濡れたら壊れちゃうし」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-swim-p",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-swim-p_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「うん。ちょっと離れた孤島が、結婚式の会場みたいだから。徒歩では無理なの、わたしはお留守番。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-swim-p",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-swim-p_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「転校生の先輩たちなら、うまくやってくれたと思うけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-swim-p",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-swim-p_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「藍乃さんの様子は、どう？　まだ、寝込んじゃってる？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-swim-p",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-swim-p_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「そっか。起きたら伝えて、頼まれたとおりに代理は果たせたと思うって。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「わたしを信用して、任せてくれてありがとう……って」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「うん。みんなが帰ってきたら、すぐそっちに戻るよ。藍乃さんをよろしくね、鯱さん」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-swim-p",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-swim-p_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「……ふうっ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-swim-p",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-swim-p_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "（協力プレイで、攻略完了……♪）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-swim-p",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-swim-p_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "（って、本来の目的って何だっけ？　みたいな感じだけど、いいよね。先輩は、無事に保護できたし。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "（あの天宮先輩ってひとは、取り逃がしたけど……？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-swim-p",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-swim-p_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "（不思議な経験、してるなぁ。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "（波間に揺れる、人魚姫の恋。婚約者のひとの気持ちに、わたしちょっと共感しちゃう）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "（好きで、好きで……。みんなに馬鹿みたいだって言われても、運命に見放されても。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "（報われなくても、好きなんだもん）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-swim-p",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-swim-p_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "（日本に戻ったら、たぶん山條先輩たちの婚約はお流れになる）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "（婚約者のひとが自分を装って、大事なものを偽って、いちばん大好きなひとに嘘をついてまで……。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "（手に入れたかった、恋なのに）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "（人魚姫みたいに、悲恋で終わる。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "（山條先輩なら今後も、お友達とか、姉妹みたいに親しく接してくれるかもしれないけど）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "（婚約者のひとが追い求めたものは、決して手に入らない）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "（友達じゃ、やだ。妹じゃ、やだもん。わかるよ、恋をしてるんだ）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "（せんぱい。ゆき。こうやって砂浜に、相合い傘を書いても）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "（すぐに波に洗われちゃう、儚い恋でも）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "（他のぜんぶを捨ててでも、何と引き換えにしてでも手に入れたかったよ）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-swim-p",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-swim-p_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「あれっ、先輩……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-swim-p",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-swim-p_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「戻ってきたんですね。他のみんなは、どうしたんですか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-swim-p",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-swim-p_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「海底に沈没船を見つけたら、お宝がないか探してる？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-swim-p",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-swim-p_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「元気だなぁ……先輩は他のみんなに比べたら泳げませんしね、先にひとりだけ戻ってきたんですね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-swim-p",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-swim-p_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「あはは、お疲れさまでした♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-swim-p",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-swim-p_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "（ふたりきり、だ。たぶん、今しかない。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "（先輩の周りはいつも賑やかで、『ふたりきりの時間』は、あぶくみたいに消えちゃうもん。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "（だから、今しかない）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "（わたしは、後悔したくない。ううん、たとえ失恋しちゃっても。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "（勇気をだせなかった、踏みだせなかった……。そんなふうな、後悔はしたくない）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "（ねえさん。わたし、ねえさんのお説教にはうんざりだから。もう、逃げないから。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "（逃げるために、この両足はあるんじゃないから）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "（踏みだすために、近づくために。前へ進むために、あるんだから）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "（ちょっと座って待ってるうちに、足が痺れちゃって。まだ、立ちあがれないけど）"
